  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Effective, Transparent and Accountable Public Financial Management Institutions Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the EC - World Bank Partnership Programme Part III for Europe and Central Asia, the specific objective of the Trust Fund is to finance selected activities under the IBRD financed Building Effective, Transparent and Accountable Public Financial Management Institutions Project in North Macedonia (Project ID P176366), whose objective is to strengthen the efficiency, transparency, and sustainability of public expenditure and increase the effectiveness of revenue administration.</narrative>
  </description>
